# PEPTO -- Philip Timmermann's measured VIC-II colours.
# The same sixteen hues as C64.PAL, but taken off real hardware:
# duller, warmer, and what a C64 on a CRT actually looked like.
#
# index rr gg bb, all hex.  A file only changes the entries it names.
#
COLOR 7 6
0 00 00 00
1 FF FF FF
2 68 37 2B
3 70 A4 B2
4 6F 3D 86
5 58 8D 43
6 35 28 79
7 B8 C7 6F
8 6F 4F 25
9 43 39 00
A 9A 67 59
B 44 44 44
C 6C 6C 6C
D 9A D2 84
E 6C 5E B5
F 95 95 95
